{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44986","headline":"兵後经永安法空寺寄悟禅师 · 皎然","name":"兵後经永安法空寺寄悟禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常说人间法自空，何言出世法还同。\n微踪旧是香林下，余烬今成火宅中。\n後夜池心生素月，春天树色起悲风。\n吾知世代相看尽，谁悟浮生似影公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}